{"timestamp":"2026-10-01T16:10:37.548Z","level":"info","event":"provider.together.response","fields":{"provider":"together","endpoint":"/chat/completions","response":{"httpStatus":200,"contentType":"text/event-stream","providerRequestId":"6c33c0fc-aws_ew1","model":"moonshotai/Kimi-K3","text":"{\"schemaVersion\":\"narration-v1\",\"targetDurationSeconds\":300,\"blocks\":[{\"outlineItemId\":\"01a0f839-1243-7c5a-995d-ef5987c7f3d0\",\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"Today we explore how giving, riches, and righteousness are not separate concerns, but integrated components of Kingdom living.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"ca763446-f8c9-7a62-b9c7-2a09335682b3\"]},{\"text\":\"Many believers treat spiritual consecration and financial management as distinct spheres, yet the Hebrew concept of Tzedakah reveals how they fuse together.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"ca763446-f8c9-7a62-b9c7-2a09335682b3\"]},{\"text\":\"We will see that true prosperity flows from covenant alignment, where generosity becomes the natural expression of a righteous standing before God.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"8002a06a-c3ea-73c3-a83e-4caa9d2ccbc3\",\"66522a60-bc03-7abf-8434-23545728a3ae\"]}]},{\"outlineItemId\":\"01a0f839-1243-76fb-a526-955c15f285bc\",\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"Proverbs chapter eight establishes that enduring riches and honor dwell specifically within the way of righteousness and the paths of justice.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"8002a06a-c3ea-73c3-a83e-4caa9d2ccbc3\"]},{\"text\":\"This wisdom causes those who love her to inherit wealth and fills their treasuries.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"8002a06a-c3ea-73c3-a83e-4caa9d2ccbc3\"]},{\"text\":\"Notice the location of this promise: wealth is not found in the pursuit of money itself, but in walking through the midst of justice.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"8002a06a-c3ea-73c3-a83e-4caa9d2ccbc3\"]},{\"text\":\"Therefore, the believer approaches prosperity not by chasing cash, but by pursuing covenant alignment with God's righteous character.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"8002a06a-c3ea-73c3-a83e-4caa9d2ccbc3\"]}]},{\"outlineItemId\":\"01a0f839-1243-705f-9e6c-8b286a2e528b\",\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"Righteousness manifests in two distinct ways in the believer's life, and understanding this distinction prevents dangerous doctrinal imbalance.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"8324c242-533b-726a-9458-03cf5d83458a\"]},{\"text\":\"First, there is positional righteousness, which ","textChunks":["{\"schemaVersion\":\"narration-v1\",\"targetDurationSeconds\":300,\"blocks\":[{\"outlineItemId\":\"01a0f839-1243-7c5a-995d-ef5987c7f3d0\",\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"Today we explore how giving, riches, and righteousness are not separate concerns, but integrated components of Kingdom living.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"ca763446-f8c9-7a62-b9c7-2a09335682b3\"]},{\"text\":\"Many believers treat spiritual consecration and financial management as distinct spheres, yet the Hebrew concept of Tzedakah reveals how they fuse together.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"ca763446-f8c9-7a62-b9c7-2a09335682b3\"]},{\"text\":\"We will see that true prosperity flows from covenant alignment, where generosity becomes the natural expression of a righteous standing before God.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"8002a06a-c3ea-73c3-a83e-4caa9d2ccbc3\",\"66522a60-bc03-7abf-8434-23545728a3ae\"]}]},{\"outlineItemId\":\"01a0f839-1243-76fb-a526-955c15f285bc\",\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"Proverbs chapter eight establishes that enduring riches and honor dwell specifically within the way of righteousness and the paths of justice.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"8002a06a-c3ea-73c3-a83e-4caa9d2ccbc3\"]},{\"text\":\"This wisdom causes those who love her to inherit wealth and fills their treasuries.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"8002a06a-c3ea-73c3-a83e-4caa9d2ccbc3\"]},{\"text\":\"Notice the location of this promise: wealth is not found in the pursuit of money itself, but in walking through the midst of justice.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"8002a06a-c3ea-73c3-a83e-4caa9d2ccbc3\"]},{\"text\":\"Therefore, the believer approaches prosperity not by chasing cash, but by pursuing covenant alignment with God's righteous character.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"8002a06a-c3ea-73c3-a83e-4caa9d2ccbc3\"]}]},{\"outlineItemId\":\"01a0f839-1243-705f-9e6c-8b286a2e528b\",\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"Righteousness manifests in two distinct ways in the believer's life, and understanding this distinction prevents dangerous doctrinal imbalance.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"8324c242-533b-726a-9458-03cf5d83458a\"]},{\"text\":\"First, there is positional righteousness, which ","serves as the legal foundation of our salvation.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"8324c242-533b-726a-9458-03cf5d83458a\"]},{\"text\":\"As Galatians chapter three and Romans chapter four declare, \\\"Abraham believed God, and it was accounted to him for righteousness.\\\"\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"8324c242-533b-726a-9458-03cf5d83458a\"],\"quotation\":true},{\"text\":\"This gift is a fixed, perfect legal credit that cannot be added to, multiplied, or diminished.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"8324c242-533b-726a-9458-03cf5d83458a\"]},{\"text\":\"Second, there is the harvest of righteousness, described in Second Corinthians chapter nine as dynamic and agricultural.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"8324c242-533b-726a-9458-03cf5d83458a\"]},{\"text\":\"Unlike the gift, this harvest can and should be multiplied.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"8324c242-533b-726a-9458-03cf5d83458a\"]},{\"text\":\"While the gift establishes permanent standing, the harvest produces visible fruit before people.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"8324c242-533b-726a-9458-03cf5d83458a\",\"edf97ec5-6993-78af-8f09-fc6f0892a758\"]}]},{\"outlineItemId\":\"01a0f839-1243-7787-a910-c32283231cc5\",\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"How you know you can beat Goliath depends entirely on who is asking.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"fb4cfa61-881b-78f2-8173-853f0e169c5b\"]},{\"text\":\"If Goliath challenges you, you stand on the covenant and declare, \\\"You dare defy the armies of the living God?\\\"\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"fb4cfa61-881b-78f2-8173-853f0e169c5b\"],\"quotation\":true},{\"text\":\"But if King Saul asks, you must point to physical evidence and say, \\\"I have killed a lion and a bear.\\\"\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"fb4cfa61-881b-78f2-8173-853f0e169c5b\"],\"quotation\":true},{\"text\":\"Before God, we present only faith and Christ's finished work; before people, we must show a visible harvest of works.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"fb4cfa61-881b-78f2-8173-853f0e169c5b\"]}]},{\"outlineItemId\":\"01a0f839-1243-74ec-88a3-7fdc47461091\",\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"Consider the poor debtor who gives his cloak as collateral for a loan.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"18fc39b0-81c3-72c2-97bd-ac","c6f572db4e\"]},{\"text\":\"Biblical law commands you to return that cloak before sundown so he can sleep, even though you legally hold it.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"18fc39b0-81c3-72c2-97bd-acc6f572db4e\"]},{\"text\":\"Similarly, business owners must leave the corners of their fields unharvested for the poor, the widow, and the stranger.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"430ee9e8-8b9d-7adf-be71-d40305e43624\"]},{\"text\":\"This builds a social safety net directly into profit-generating activities.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"430ee9e8-8b9d-7adf-be71-d40305e43624\"]}]},{\"outlineItemId\":\"01a0f839-1243-769e-9c9b-6f91ad3e312f\",\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"In Second Corinthians chapter nine, Paul connects righteousness directly with financial generosity using agricultural metaphors.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"66522a60-bc03-7abf-8434-23545728a3ae\"]},{\"text\":\"True Christian generosity is not forced compliance or a compliance gimmick, but a natural, willing overflow of spiritual righteousness.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"66522a60-bc03-7abf-8434-23545728a3ae\"]},{\"text\":\"Sowing sparingly describes not merely the financial quantity, but the state of the giver's heart.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"66522a60-bc03-7abf-8434-23545728a3ae\"]},{\"text\":\"It means giving out of reluctant compulsion or exhaustion, lacking excitement or love.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"66522a60-bc03-7abf-8434-23545728a3ae\"]},{\"text\":\"In contrast, the bountiful sower operates from divine contentment, remembering that \\\"godliness with contentment is great gain.\\\"\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"66522a60-bc03-7abf-8434-23545728a3ae\"],\"quotation\":true},{\"text\":\"This contentment allows them to give sacrificially and joyfully.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"66522a60-bc03-7abf-8434-23545728a3ae\"]}]},{\"outlineItemId\":\"01a0f839-1243-7b9a-8971-60c268a95ce9\",\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"To fully grasp Biblical righteousness, we must look past the language barrier to the Hebrew word Tzedakah.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"ca763446-f8c9-7a62-b9c7-2a09335682b3\"]},{\"text\":\"While English splits morality, justice, and charity into separate c","ategories, the Hebrew mind understood them as inseparable parts of a single whole.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"ca763446-f8c9-7a62-b9c7-2a09335682b3\"]},{\"text\":\"Tzedakah encompasses three critical ramifications.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"ca763446-f8c9-7a62-b9c7-2a09335682b3\"]},{\"text\":\"First, it means personal morality: internal rectitude, standing clean before God, and refusing to lie, steal, or compromise.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"ac2e0a05-29b4-74c8-a832-f25b79a51268\"]},{\"text\":\"Second, it means justice: structural fairness that refuses to oppress the vulnerable in societal, legal, and business transactions.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"168b403a-2303-7e1a-ae75-b2ebe56da6b2\"]},{\"text\":\"Third, it means charity and generosity, which Scripture classifies not as optional benevolence but as justice itself.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"0f6e5794-b307-734e-83ba-78fb071fdb2c\"]},{\"text\":\"To withhold help from the poor when you have the power to give is to violate Tzedakah.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"0f6e5794-b307-734e-83ba-78fb071fdb2c\"]}]},{\"outlineItemId\":\"01a0f839-1243-7886-9ea7-5c5be42bb5f2\",\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"Kingdom Economics operates on laws that directly contradict the ruthless, self-serving capitalistic models of the world.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"564578eb-71d4-7e3e-8488-3848c22e28c8\"]},{\"text\":\"First, fairness must override legal rights, as shown in the command to return a debtor's cloak before sundown.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"18fc39b0-81c3-72c2-97bd-acc6f572db4e\"]},{\"text\":\"Second, the Jubilee cycle institutes periodic debt cancellation every seven years, forbidding lenders to withhold help because the cancellation year approaches.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"0b868713-69cd-771a-878c-1eea34533435\"]},{\"text\":\"Third, business models must leave gleanings for the poor, integrating social safety nets into profit activities.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"430ee9e8-8b9d-7adf-be71-d40305e43624\"]},{\"text\":\"Fourth, workers must receive prompt payment, for withholding wages brings the woe declared in Jeremiah chapter twenty-two.\",\"sourceBlockI","ds\":[\"4e2a0f33-eea5-7122-b69a-0bff630089a2\"]},{\"text\":\"Finally, believers must refuse to exploit bargaining power, never monetizing another person's desperation to buy assets at ridiculous prices.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"27e07c83-25f3-71f7-8ec7-7c49dac6fa11\"]}]},{\"outlineItemId\":\"01a0f839-1243-705b-b0c9-121da14f44b6\",\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"Two core truths govern financial stewardship.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"eb6a2bc7-bdc4-7678-a65e-be6523f45587\",\"0ea74d78-5376-73c9-8272-67103c85ee27\"]},{\"text\":\"First, Deuteronomy chapter eight declares that God gives the power to get wealth, depositing intellectual capacity, physical skills, and opportunities.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"eb6a2bc7-bdc4-7678-a65e-be6523f45587\"]},{\"text\":\"Therefore we are managers rather than owners; in the Kingdom economy, owners are treated as rebels.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"eb6a2bc7-bdc4-7678-a65e-be6523f45587\",\"b4cbbbae-9d05-7bca-bf3e-c383435f4f24\"]},{\"text\":\"Second, God demands accountability for growth, as illustrated in the Parable of the Talents where the master expected the same standard of faithfulness from every servant regardless of the amount entrusted.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"0ea74d78-5376-73c9-8272-67103c85ee27\"]},{\"text\":\"Your current financial level is a stewardship test.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"0ea74d78-5376-73c9-8272-67103c85ee27\"]},{\"text\":\"Apply these truths to the five pillars: budgeting and tracking, protection, savings, investment, and debt management.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"39e85a0e-0674-7710-9ccd-11af0584acb1\"]}]},{\"outlineItemId\":\"01a0f839-1243-75c5-8530-497bd00b84d8\",\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"True riches flow from walking in Tzedakah, where morality, justice, and generosity are inseparable.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"ca763446-f8c9-7a62-b9c7-2a09335682b3\"]},{\"text\":\"Righteousness is both a gift received by faith and a harvest multiplied through works.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"8324c242-533b-726a-9458-03cf5d83458a\"]},{\"text\":\"Generosity is the cheerful overflow of this righteousness, and financial stewardship is the practica","l management of God's resources according to Kingdom laws that prioritize justice over profit.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"66522a60-bc03-7abf-8434-23545728a3ae\",\"39e85a0e-0674-7710-9ccd-11af0584acb1\"]},{\"text\":\"When you understand these truths, you stop chasing money and start pursuing the way of righteousness, where enduring riches and honor are found.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"8002a06a-c3ea-73c3-a83e-4caa9d2ccbc3\"]}]}]}"],"textChunksTruncated":false,"textCharacters":10411,"reasoningCharacters":0,"finishReason":"stop","inputTokens":"[REDACTED]","outputTokens":"[REDACTED]"},"retries":0,"latencyMs":46050,"service":"pipeline-worker","correlationId":"01a0f837-11f4-7327-b2e1-c70e2e9ecef6"}}
